stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received: model emits tool call
    Received --> Validated: parse schema + find runtime
    Received --> Rejected: invalid or unavailable tool
    Validated --> Forbidden: policy denies
    Validated --> ApprovalPending: policy requires user decision
    Validated --> Ready: policy allows
    ApprovalPending --> Ready: user allows
    ApprovalPending --> Denied: user denies
    Ready --> Sandboxed: construct permission/sandbox policy
    Sandboxed --> Running: start handler or process
    Running --> Completed: typed result
    Running --> Failed: execution error
    Running --> Cancelled: turn cancellation
    Rejected --> ModelOutput: structured tool error
    Forbidden --> ModelOutput: structured denial
    Denied --> ModelOutput: structured denial
    Completed --> ModelOutput: call_id-correlated output
    Failed --> ModelOutput: call_id-correlated error
    Cancelled --> ModelOutput: interrupted output
    ModelOutput --> [*]
